release_notes:
MONO LAB 5.2
Tear Table and Copy Bed UX fine tuning

// TEAR TABLE. A new surface tool. Tear your image into pieces like paper (draw the tear lines yourself) then rearrange the scraps into a collage and flatten at full resolution.

//COPY BED - Run your image through a machine that was never serviced and move the image while you do. Duplication with degradation.

// FINE CONTROL! Every slider now supports fine-precision scrubbing - drag away from the track to slow the scale down.
